  "title": "Energy Retail in 2026: Trends That Will Define the Year",
  "summary": "Energy retail is entering a phase where long-term decisions start to take hold. Across Europe, retailers face the same underlying tension. Customer expectations are rising, market shares are becoming more fluid, and value is increasingly tied to how well consumption can be steered, not just supplied. Based on what we see across markets, customers, and partners, we have identified five trends that will shape how energy retail evolves in the year ahead.",
